  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 10,000eb (Super Luxury)<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Fashionware<br>\n<strong>Install:</strong> Clinic<br>\n<strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> None<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 1</p>\n<p>Fashionware. Replaces a whole skin layer with techno-organic metal. +3 Wardrobe &amp; Style while not covered by outer clothing or armor; it doesn't stack with any other Superchrome bonus. Incompatible with every form of Subdermal Armor, but compatible with Skinweave.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corgo lists no Humanity Loss for this piece (N/A), so it is set to 0.</li>\n<li>The +3 is situational because it only applies while the skin is uncovered: tick it in the roll dialog.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Fashionware).</em></p>"
